{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13476","headline":"玄元皇帝应角贺圣祚无疆 · 殷寅","name":"玄元皇帝应角贺圣祚无疆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应历生周日，修祠表汉年。\n复兹秦岭上，更似霍山前。\n昔赞神功啓，今符圣祚延。\n已题金简字，仍访玉堂仙。\n睿祖光元始，曾孙体又玄。\n言因六梦接，庆叶九龄传。\n北阙心超矣，南山寿固然。\n无由同拜庆，窃拚贺陶甄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷寅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}